# Feature name: age_bin
# Feature description: Categorizes numerical age into bins representing youth, young adult, mid-adult, elderly. These bins capture general age group trends in credit approval decisions.
# Usefulness: Age groups can provide demographic insights as certain lenders may favor approval for specific populations. Binning reduces the risk of overfitting since it limits variability.
