# Feature name: employment_duration_bin
# Feature description: Converts the employment categorical variable into a numerical binary variable, where employees considered stable (>=7) are assigned 1, and others are assigned 0, indicating employment stability.
# Usefulness: Employees with stable employment (>=7 years) are likely to have higher creditworthiness compared to others. This binary feature simplifies the employment data for better downstream analysis, enabling the model to capture employment stability as a contributing factor for receiving credit.

df['employment_duration_bin'] = df['employment'].apply(lambda x: 1 if x == '>=7' else 0)
end

python
# Feature name: savings_status_rank
